{"id":81,"name":"التكوير","transliteration":"At-Takwir","translation_fr":"L'obscurcissement","translation_en":"The Overthrowing","type":"meccan","total_verses":29,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِذَا ٱلشَّمۡسُ كُوِّرَتۡ","translation_fr":"Quand le soleil sera obscurci","translation_en":"When the sun is wrapped up [in darkness]","transliteration":"Itha alshshamsu kuwwirat"},{"id":2,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ ٱنكَدَرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et que les étoiles deviendront ternes","translation_en":"And when the stars fall, dispersing","transliteration":"Waitha alnnujoomu inkadarat"},{"id":3,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et les montagnes mises en marche","translation_en":"And when the mountains are removed","transliteration":"Waitha aljibalu suyyirat"},{"id":4,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتۡ","translation_fr":"et les chamelles à terme, négligées","translation_en":"And when full-term she-camels are neglected","transliteration":"Waitha alAAisharu AAuttilat"},{"id":5,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et les bêtes farouches, rassemblées","translation_en":"And when the wild beasts are gathered","transliteration":"Waitha alwuhooshu hushirat"},{"id":6,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et les mers allumées","translation_en":"And when the seas are filled with flame","transliteration":"Waitha albiharu sujjirat"},{"id":7,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلنُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتۡ","translation_fr":"et les âmes accouplées","translation_en":"And when the souls are paired","transliteration":"Waitha alnnufoosu zuwwijat"},{"id":8,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡمَوۡءُۥدَةُ سُئِلَتۡ","translation_fr":"et qu'on demandera à la fillette enterrée vivante","translation_en":"And when the girl [who was] buried alive is asked","transliteration":"Waitha almawoodatu suilat"},{"id":9,"text":"بِأَيِّ ذَنۢبٖ قُتِلَتۡ","translation_fr":"pour quel péché elle a été tuée","translation_en":"For what sin she was killed","transliteration":"Biayyi thanbin qutilat"},{"id":10,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتۡ","translation_fr":"Et quand les feuilles seront déployées","translation_en":"And when the pages are made public","transliteration":"Waitha alssuhufu nushirat"},{"id":11,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتۡ","translation_fr":"et le ciel écorché","translation_en":"And when the sky is stripped away","transliteration":"Waitha alssamao kushitat"},{"id":12,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et la fournaise attisée","translation_en":"And when Hellfire is set ablaze","transliteration":"Waitha aljaheemu suAAAAirat"},{"id":13,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجَنَّةُ أُزۡلِفَتۡ","translation_fr":"et le Paradis rapproché","translation_en":"And when Paradise is brought near","transliteration":"Waitha aljannatu ozlifat"},{"id":14,"text":"عَلِمَتۡ نَفۡسٞ مَّآ أَحۡضَرَتۡ","translation_fr":"chaque âme saura ce qu'elle a présenté","translation_en":"A soul will [then] know what it has brought [with it]","transliteration":"AAalimat nafsun ma ahdarat"},{"id":15,"text":"فَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِٱلۡخُنَّسِ","translation_fr":"Non!... Je jure par les planètes qui gravitent","translation_en":"So I swear by the retreating stars","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bialkhunnasi"},{"id":16,"text":"ٱلۡجَوَارِ ٱلۡكُنَّسِ","translation_fr":"qui courent et disparaissent","translation_en":"Those that run [their courses] and disappear","transliteration":"Aljawari alkunnasi"},{"id":17,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا عَسۡعَسَ","translation_fr":"par la nuit quand elle survient","translation_en":"And by the night as it closes in","transliteration":"Waallayli itha AAasAAasa"},{"id":18,"text":"وَٱلصُّبۡحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ","translation_fr":"et par l'aube quand elle exhale son souffle","translation_en":"And by the dawn when it breathes","transliteration":"Waalssubhi itha tanaffasa"},{"id":19,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوۡلُ رَسُولٖ كَرِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Ceci [le Coran] est la parole d'un noble Messager","translation_en":"[That] indeed, the Qur'an is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlu rasoolin kareemin"},{"id":20,"text":"ذِي قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِي ٱلۡعَرۡشِ مَكِينٖ","translation_fr":"doué d'une grande force, et ayant un rang élevé auprès du Maître du Trône","translation_en":"[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position]","transliteration":"Thee quwwatin AAinda thee alAAarshi makeenin"},{"id":21,"text":"مُّطَاعٖ ثَمَّ أَمِينٖ","translation_fr":"obéi, là-haut, et digne de confiance","translation_en":"Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy","transliteration":"MutaAAin thamma ameenin"},{"id":22,"text":"وَمَا صَاحِبُكُم بِمَجۡنُونٖ","translation_fr":"Votre compagnon (Muhammad) n'est nullement fou","translation_en":"And your companion is not [at all] mad","transliteration":"Wama sahibukum bimajnoonin"},{"id":23,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ رَءَاهُ بِٱلۡأُفُقِ ٱلۡمُبِينِ","translation_fr":"il l'a effectivement vu (Gabriel), au clair horizon","translation_en":"And he has already seen Gabriel in the clear horizon","transliteration":"Walaqad raahu bialofuqi almubeeni"},{"id":24,"text":"وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ٱلۡغَيۡبِ بِضَنِينٖ","translation_fr":"et il ne garde pas avarement pour lui-même ce qui lui a été révélé","translation_en":"And Muhammad is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen","transliteration":"Wama huwa AAala alghaybi bidaneenin"},{"id":25,"text":"وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوۡلِ شَيۡطَٰنٖ رَّجِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Et ceci [le Coran] n'est point la parole d'un diable banni","translation_en":"And the Qur'an is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens]","transliteration":"Wama huwa biqawli shaytanin rajeemin"},{"id":26,"text":"فَأَيۡنَ تَذۡهَبُونَ","translation_fr":"Où allez-vous donc","translation_en":"So where are you going","transliteration":"Faayna tathhaboona"},{"id":27,"text":"إِنۡ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكۡرٞ لِّلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Ceci n'est qu'un rappel pour l'univers","translation_en":"It is not except a reminder to the worlds","transliteration":"In huwa illa thikrun lilAAalameena"},{"id":28,"text":"لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمۡ أَن يَسۡتَقِيمَ","translation_fr":"pour celui d'entre vous qui veut suivre le chemin droit","translation_en":"For whoever wills among you to take a right course","transliteration":"Liman shaa minkum an yastaqeema"},{"id":29,"text":"وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Mais vous ne pouvez vouloir, que si Allah veut, [Lui], le Seigneur de l'Univers","translation_en":"And you do not will except that Allah wills - Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Wama tashaoona illa an yashaa Allahu rabbu alAAalameena"}]}